                                     "text":  "I dined at this private kitchen. The ingredients were fresh and delicious, and the service was impeccable! The chefs put a lot of thought into the plating! And because the location was a bit secluded, chatting with the chef was incredibly pleasant! I highly recommend dining here!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
