                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "They offer set meals and business lunches on weekdays, and their no-menu menu is highly recommended. The Japanese teppanyaki style combined with French techniques is a highlight. They currently have a spring set menu for NT$1680, which is a great deal for a no-menu menu. It includes American short ribs, tiger prawns, scallops, and more. The sauces and side dishes are also very well-made, making for a very satisfying meal.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "平日有供應定食也有商業午餐，特別推薦無菜單料理，日式鐵板燒結合法式手藝，目前有推出春季套餐，一套1680，以無菜單料理來說這價格很划算，能夠吃到美國牛小排、斑節海大蝦、干貝等，而且醬料還有配菜也都非常用心，整套吃下來非常飽足",
